(6440274, 956265, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, don''t mind the duotone (this shade of yellow makes me think of money), but I must say, I absolutely dislike the border treatment. <br/> <br/>of the image, what initially drew me in was the bottom left corner, and following the interesting road textures. The man is ho-hum, nothing great to me, I don''t get much story from him, but then in the left most corner of the image, I''m captivated by the illuminated graffiti, and I''m stuck trying to figure out what they are. <br/> <br/>in closing, awesome photo, lose the border.</td>', 'I like the shot, don''t mind the duotone (this shade of yellow makes me think of money), but I must say, I absolutely dislike the border treatment.  of the image, what initially drew me in was the bottom left corner, and following the interesting road textures. The man is ho-hum, nothing great to me, I don''t get much story from him, but then in the left most corner of the image, I''m captivated by the illuminated graffiti, and I''m stuck trying to figure out what they are.  in closing, awesome photo, lose the border.', '2011-06-10 07:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
