(6440515, 955293, 99263, '<td valign="top">Man made? Isn''t it the sun then. A torch or some other light source? Nicely done anyway.</td>', 'Man made? Isn''t it the sun then. A torch or some other light source? Nicely done anyway.', '2011-06-10 12:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440516, 956316, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette</td>', 'Nice silhouette', '2011-06-10 12:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440517, 955987, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really artfully done.  Not expected.  I like it. 8</td>', 'Really artfully done.  Not expected.  I like it. 8', '2011-06-10 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440519, 955987, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very striking image. Really nicely done.</td>', 'Very striking image. Really nicely done.', '2011-06-10 12:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440520, 956234, 15711, '<td valign="top">Are you getting comments that you can still see detail in their faces thus it isn''t a silhouette?  I have to agree.  The definition is dimly lit, not jet black.  Ok, I''ll get off of my soap box.  Just wanted to vent because I''m getting those sorts of comments on mine. :)</td>', 'Are you getting comments that you can still see detail in their faces thus it isn''t a silhouette?  I have to agree.  The definition is dimly lit, not jet black.  Ok, I''ll get off of my soap box.  Just wanted to vent because I''m getting those sorts of comments on mine. :)', '2011-06-10 12:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440521, 956052, 99263, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and unusual landscape silhouette.</td>', 'A beautiful and unusual landscape silhouette.', '2011-06-10 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440522, 955396, 99263, '<td valign="top">Strong composition. Not very "nightlike" but very nice anyway.</td>', 'Strong composition. Not very "nightlike" but very nice anyway.', '2011-06-10 12:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440523, 956167, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. Looks like an airgun to me by the way.</td>', 'Nicely executed. Looks like an airgun to me by the way.', '2011-06-10 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440524, 956302, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but looks a little bit flat to me.</td>', 'Nice shot but looks a little bit flat to me.', '2011-06-10 12:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440526, 956163, 99263, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up and execution</td>', 'Interesting set up and execution', '2011-06-10 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440527, 956130, 99263, '<td valign="top">Creatively different</td>', 'Creatively different', '2011-06-10 12:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440529, 955954, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene.</td>', 'Wonderful scene.', '2011-06-10 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440530, 956258, 99263, '<td valign="top">Looks so cool in that pool</td>', 'Looks so cool in that pool', '2011-06-10 13:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440531, 955905, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely beach scene and silhouettes</td>', 'Lovely beach scene and silhouettes', '2011-06-10 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440532, 956185, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done and does indeed invoke a very dreamlike feeling.</td>', 'Very nicely done and does indeed invoke a very dreamlike feeling.', '2011-06-10 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440533, 956184, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is really very nicely done and fits the challenge theme perfectly.</td>', 'This is really very nicely done and fits the challenge theme perfectly.', '2011-06-10 13:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440535, 956135, 99263, '<td valign="top">Electrifying shot</td>', 'Electrifying shot', '2011-06-10 13:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440536, 956272, 99263, '<td valign="top">Oooh she is a fearsome witch with her iron teeth</td>', 'Oooh she is a fearsome witch with her iron teeth', '2011-06-10 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440539, 956136, 99263, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s a very energetic person. Nice image.</td>', 'Looks like he''s a very energetic person. Nice image.', '2011-06-10 13:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440540, 955323, 99263, '<td valign="top">Shapeshifter?</td>', 'Shapeshifter?', '2011-06-10 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440542, 956318, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and glowing colors</td>', 'Nice lighting and glowing colors', '2011-06-10 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440543, 956319, 99263, '<td valign="top">Orders are orders soldier</td>', 'Orders are orders soldier', '2011-06-10 13:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440545, 956125, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is great. Super close-up. Love that you can still see the dark bodies in the darker area too. Very nice.</td>', 'This is great. Super close-up. Love that you can still see the dark bodies in the darker area too. Very nice.', '2011-06-10 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440547, 956261, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Lovely pinkish background color. Reminds me a little of an image I have in my portfolio from another challenge called "Free Spirit"</td>', 'Very nice. Lovely pinkish background color. Reminds me a little of an image I have in my portfolio from another challenge called "Free Spirit"', '2011-06-10 13:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440548, 956234, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is a great silhouette shot. Great backdrop. Nicely posed by the 2 models. Super.</td>', 'This is a great silhouette shot. Great backdrop. Nicely posed by the 2 models. Super.', '2011-06-10 13:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440549, 956278, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely colorful backdrop. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely colorful backdrop. Very nicely done.', '2011-06-10 13:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440550, 956322, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice Alfred Hitchcock set up. The model''s side profile even matches pretty closely. Is this what you had in mind or is it a coincidence? The Alfred Hitchcock thing I mean.</td>', 'Nice Alfred Hitchcock set up. The model''s side profile even matches pretty closely. Is this what you had in mind or is it a coincidence? The Alfred Hitchcock thing I mean.', '2011-06-10 13:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440551, 956295, 99263, '<td valign="top">Powerful</td>', 'Powerful', '2011-06-10 13:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440564, 955396, 30214, '<td valign="top">looks very familiar :). You will get dinged for it is not really a silhouette... Nice shot though.</td>', 'looks very familiar :). You will get dinged for it is not really a silhouette... Nice shot though.', '2011-06-10 13:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440565, 956272, 30214, '<td valign="top">don''t know how many people will get the title, but I of course love it... and the shot.</td>', 'don''t know how many people will get the title, but I of course love it... and the shot.', '2011-06-10 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440593, 955396, 67152, '<td valign="top">a beautiful image but i am wondering if you missed the concept of silhoutte</td>', 'a beautiful image but i am wondering if you missed the concept of silhoutte', '2011-06-10 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440625, 955483, 113591, '<td valign="top">Double wow!</td>', 'Double wow!', '2011-06-10 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440630, 956272, 61396, '<td valign="top">I think I can see her evil expression, but then it can be her smile, or leaves of some plant.</td>', 'I think I can see her evil expression, but then it can be her smile, or leaves of some plant.', '2011-06-10 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440635, 956288, 113591, '<td valign="top">-3 points as I did not get the invite. :)</td>', '-3 points as I did not get the invite. :)', '2011-06-10 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440636, 956323, 113591, '<td valign="top">Funny, the half on the left seems to be facing away, and the other half towards us. Scary.</td>', 'Funny, the half on the left seems to be facing away, and the other half towards us. Scary.', '2011-06-10 15:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440637, 955413, 113591, '<td valign="top">Nice fingerwork Hehe</td>', 'Nice fingerwork Hehe', '2011-06-10 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440638, 955965, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how you resist the compulsion to straighten stuff according to some arbitrary guidelines. I equally like the mystery surrounding the trio (if they are a family, why don''t they relate one to the others?). Processing also works.</td>', 'I like how you resist the compulsion to straighten stuff according to some arbitrary guidelines. I equally like the mystery surrounding the trio (if they are a family, why don''t they relate one to the others?). Processing also works.', '2011-06-10 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6440725, 955214, 134121, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting</td>', 'Awesome lighting', '2011-06-10 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440734, 956322, 33068, '<td valign="top">Something about this reminds me of Alfred Hitchcock.  Very nice.</td>', 'Something about this reminds me of Alfred Hitchcock.  Very nice.', '2011-06-10 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440736, 955396, 33068, '<td valign="top">Hmm....I don''t see a silhouette but this is a fantastic shot nonetheless.  Should have saved it for a free study.</td>', 'Hmm....I don''t see a silhouette but this is a fantastic shot nonetheless.  Should have saved it for a free study.', '2011-06-10 16:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440737, 956184, 33068, '<td valign="top">Killer.</td>', 'Killer.', '2011-06-10 16:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440739, 956320, 33068, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion you captured in this shot.</td>', 'Love the emotion you captured in this shot.', '2011-06-10 16:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440800, 955267, 86958, '<td valign="top">Exceptional!</td>', 'Exceptional!', '2011-06-10 18:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440832, 955987, 106931, '<td valign="top">Perfect...</td>', 'Perfect...', '2011-06-10 19:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440834, 956268, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, but the noise is just too distracting. It''s all the colors in the noise that ruins it. If only you could have gotten rid of all the colors in the side of the building, I love the yellows/oranges in the windows, just not the reds/blues &amp; greens in the building itself. (long winded, sorry)</td>', 'I love the shot, but the noise is just too distracting. It''s all the colors in the noise that ruins it. If only you could have gotten rid of all the colors in the side of the building, I love the yellows/oranges in the windows, just not the reds/blues & greens in the building itself. (long winded, sorry)', '2011-06-10 19:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440922, 955483, 47470, '<td valign="top">As beautiful as the night sky is, I wish the title would have let me come to that conclusion on my own : )</td>', 'As beautiful as the night sky is, I wish the title would have let me come to that conclusion on my own : )', '2011-06-10 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440923, 955267, 47470, '<td valign="top">What a great catch!  I wish you would have used the Advanced Editing rules to their fullest by pulling a bit more drama from the sky, but I''m not going to ding you for that.</td>', 'What a great catch!  I wish you would have used the Advanced Editing rules to their fullest by pulling a bit more drama from the sky, but I''m not going to ding you for that.', '2011-06-10 22:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440924, 956272, 47470, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but I know two things.  First, it''s not a silhouette, and second, it looks pretty cool nonetheless.  I''m not voting on this picture, but I just wanted to say that this looks cool, even if you''re getting a lot of DNMCs.  Can''t wait to find out what it is!</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but I know two things.  First, it''s not a silhouette, and second, it looks pretty cool nonetheless.  I''m not voting on this picture, but I just wanted to say that this looks cool, even if you''re getting a lot of DNMCs.  Can''t wait to find out what it is!', '2011-06-10 22:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440926, 956320, 47470, '<td valign="top">Definitely a creeper : )  Love the angle, the flare/burst, the texture of the droplets of water, and the sliver of light on his face.  Very well planned!</td>', 'Definitely a creeper : )  Love the angle, the flare/burst, the texture of the droplets of water, and the sliver of light on his face.  Very well planned!', '2011-06-10 22:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440927, 956135, 47470, '<td valign="top">Cool lightning capture.  I wish the horizontal made by the tops of the trees wasn''t right in the middle.</td>', 'Cool lightning capture.  I wish the horizontal made by the tops of the trees wasn''t right in the middle.', '2011-06-10 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440933, 956288, 47470, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the curve along the side of the image, but the subject matter just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'I absolutely love the curve along the side of the image, but the subject matter just doesn''t do it for me.', '2011-06-10 22:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440934, 956179, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the division of the colors.  I wonder if there was a way you could have used a long lens and wide aperture to blur out the foreground and the background to emphasize the trees and blur out the parts that aren''t as pretty.</td>', 'I love the division of the colors.  I wonder if there was a way you could have used a long lens and wide aperture to blur out the foreground and the background to emphasize the trees and blur out the parts that aren''t as pretty.', '2011-06-10 22:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440939, 956126, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t lit this with a car.  It is giving me a really uneasy feeling, as if the beautiful newly-weds are about to get run over!</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t lit this with a car.  It is giving me a really uneasy feeling, as if the beautiful newly-weds are about to get run over!', '2011-06-10 22:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440945, 956258, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the subject was a little closer in the frame.  I really had no idea what i was looking at until I read the title.</td>', 'I wish the subject was a little closer in the frame.  I really had no idea what i was looking at until I read the title.', '2011-06-10 22:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440947, 955483, 39057, '<td valign="top">Well ...went through 5 shots and this is the best so far ! I hope I''m not being duped by a cut out figure pasted on a computer screen !</td>', 'Well ...went through 5 shots and this is the best so far ! I hope I''m not being duped by a cut out figure pasted on a computer screen !', '2011-06-10 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440949, 956185, 47470, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to bump this up.  It really is a very whimsical, dreamlike scene.  The tones are lovely.</td>', 'I keep coming back to bump this up.  It really is a very whimsical, dreamlike scene.  The tones are lovely.', '2011-06-10 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440950, 956198, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would look like with the person centered in the image.  I think a center composition would emphasize the loneliness (and harshness) implied by the b''n''w, game/title, starkness of the room, and the facelessness.</td>', 'I wonder what this would look like with the person centered in the image.  I think a center composition would emphasize the loneliness (and harshness) implied by the b''n''w, game/title, starkness of the room, and the facelessness.', '2011-06-10 23:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440951, 956265, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t know exactly what it is about this image, but it instantly gave me the feeling of excitement and contentedness and slight drunkenness that you feel when you step out of a steaming hot club into the cool, damp summer night air, laughing, surrounded by friends.  And that''s funny because there is nothing here that looks particularly happy.  Maybe it''s just that the long line of cars make it look like an exciting night to be out on the town : )<br/> <br/>The texture on the ground is gorgeous, by the way!</td>', 'I don''t know exactly what it is about this image, but it instantly gave me the feeling of excitement and contentedness and slight drunkenness that you feel when you step out of a steaming hot club into the cool, damp summer night air, laughing, surrounded by friends.  And that''s funny because there is nothing here that looks particularly happy.  Maybe it''s just that the long line of cars make it look like an exciting night to be out on the town : ) The texture on the ground is gorgeous, by the way!', '2011-06-10 23:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440952, 955396, 47470, '<td valign="top">The texture in the supports and the water is beautiful.  I wish she had been raven haired and wearing a darker top so this would have fit the challenge better.  Not dinging you for that though, since the picture is really nice anyway.</td>', 'The texture in the supports and the water is beautiful.  I wish she had been raven haired and wearing a darker top so this would have fit the challenge better.  Not dinging you for that though, since the picture is really nice anyway.', '2011-06-10 23:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440954, 955784, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I like the title, but I also can''t imagine you could have done anything else to increase the feeling of unease in this image (which I assume is what you were going for!).</td>', 'I can''t say I like the title, but I also can''t imagine you could have done anything else to increase the feeling of unease in this image (which I assume is what you were going for!).', '2011-06-10 23:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440955, 956323, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped some from the top and the left to off-set the subject and emphasize the leading lines.  I love the texture on the walls and the ground, and I love the way the light shines off them.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped some from the top and the left to off-set the subject and emphasize the leading lines.  I love the texture on the walls and the ground, and I love the way the light shines off them.', '2011-06-10 23:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440958, 955992, 47470, '<td valign="top">Even though the strong leading lines and bright spot on the left are so prominent, my eye still gets stuck on that one foot, making me wish I could see more.  That must mean something good for the photo.  I think I might have cropped a bit from the bottom though.<br/> <br/>I also just realized that you received my 1000th comment.  Congrats : )</td>', 'Even though the strong leading lines and bright spot on the left are so prominent, my eye still gets stuck on that one foot, making me wish I could see more.  That must mean something good for the photo.  I think I might have cropped a bit from the bottom though. I also just realized that you received my 1000th comment.  Congrats : )', '2011-06-10 23:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440959, 955987, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the simple color palate and the slight haze.</td>', 'I love the simple color palate and the slight haze.', '2011-06-10 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440960, 956319, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the grain in this.  Somehow it fits very well and reminds me of something a young boy in the 1950s would have photographed when he was experimenting with his new fancy camera.</td>', 'I love the grain in this.  Somehow it fits very well and reminds me of something a young boy in the 1950s would have photographed when he was experimenting with his new fancy camera.', '2011-06-10 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441016, 955396, 117534, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, not sure they''re gonna say silhouette, but AWESOME AWESOME, I''m gonna say Silhouette!!!</td>', 'Awesome photo, not sure they''re gonna say silhouette, but AWESOME AWESOME, I''m gonna say Silhouette!!!', '2011-06-11 00:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441035, 955171, 70484, '<td valign="top">The smoke is like a reverse silhouette. I really like this pic. Very creative.</td>', 'The smoke is like a reverse silhouette. I really like this pic. Very creative.', '2011-06-11 01:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441039, 956278, 70484, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s some attitude in this pic :-) I really like it. The colors are great!</td>', 'Wow, there''s some attitude in this pic :-) I really like it. The colors are great!', '2011-06-11 01:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441040, 956135, 70484, '<td valign="top">What a great challenge for a stormy night! Nicely captured.</td>', 'What a great challenge for a stormy night! Nicely captured.', '2011-06-11 01:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441042, 956307, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and you get points for being creative with making the silhouette. I don''t know if it''s my favorite pic, probably because the person partly in the frame at the left is distracting.</td>', 'I really like the idea and you get points for being creative with making the silhouette. I don''t know if it''s my favorite pic, probably because the person partly in the frame at the left is distracting.', '2011-06-11 02:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441044, 956266, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like the deep blue tones here. However, I don''t think I am crazy for the blue lines in the framing.</td>', 'I like the deep blue tones here. However, I don''t think I am crazy for the blue lines in the framing.', '2011-06-11 02:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441049, 955767, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. It does feel like it''s tilted a little bit though. But I love the color of the sky.</td>', 'I like this picture. It does feel like it''s tilted a little bit though. But I love the color of the sky.', '2011-06-11 02:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441050, 955954, 70484, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2011-06-11 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441053, 955965, 70484, '<td valign="top">Love the mood created by this picture! Great pic and processing. I love it!</td>', 'Love the mood created by this picture! Great pic and processing. I love it!', '2011-06-11 02:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441092, 955267, 27133, '<td valign="top">The winner!</td>', 'The winner!', '2011-06-11 03:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441114, 955629, 113156, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear his thoughts, very endearing photo indeed.</td>', 'I can almost hear his thoughts, very endearing photo indeed.', '2011-06-11 06:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441252, 956322, 94815, '<td valign="top">So much potential just misses. The excess space around the subject really diminishes its impact as does its slightly off-centered comp. Possible remedy: crops off both sides and comp centered on the tip of his nose. I wanted to give a 9 for beautiful tones and the purest silhouette in the challenge, but sorry just a 7.</td>', 'So much potential just misses. The excess space around the subject really diminishes its impact as does its slightly off-centered comp. Possible remedy: crops off both sides and comp centered on the tip of his nose. I wanted to give a 9 for beautiful tones and the purest silhouette in the challenge, but sorry just a 7.', '2011-06-11 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441253, 955629, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very evocative and the apparently natural incandescent lighting color is perfect.</td>', 'Very evocative and the apparently natural incandescent lighting color is perfect.', '2011-06-11 13:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441254, 956198, 94815, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too studied and some annoying halos but still a 6 for a good idea.</td>', 'Seems a bit too studied and some annoying halos but still a 6 for a good idea.', '2011-06-11 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441255, 956265, 94815, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this gritty, atmospheric shot a 6 in spite of the elegent, drawing room border which I find to be absolutely out of place.</td>', 'I''m giving this gritty, atmospheric shot a 6 in spite of the elegent, drawing room border which I find to be absolutely out of place.', '2011-06-11 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441258, 956323, 94815, '<td valign="top">Spot on execution with no observable processing artifacts in spite of impossibly difficult lighting. Strong image and my pick to take blue.</td>', 'Spot on execution with no observable processing artifacts in spite of impossibly difficult lighting. Strong image and my pick to take blue.', '2011-06-11 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441431, 955965, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very interesting POV, I enjoy the tone of this image a lot.</td>', 'Very interesting POV, I enjoy the tone of this image a lot.', '2011-06-11 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441432, 956316, 58634, '<td valign="top">Different shot than most. I enjoy the tree leaves that sort of frame the image very nicely.</td>', 'Different shot than most. I enjoy the tree leaves that sort of frame the image very nicely.', '2011-06-11 19:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441435, 955483, 58634, '<td valign="top">The sky certainly looks gorgeous in this image. I feel like your subject could be sharper, but if you had a long exposure, I can see how this would be hard, especially with a person just ''standing'' there waiting for the time to pass. <br/>I think having 2 people gazing at the sky, maybe holding hands, or interacting in some way, would''ve helped you.</td>', 'The sky certainly looks gorgeous in this image. I feel like your subject could be sharper, but if you had a long exposure, I can see how this would be hard, especially with a person just ''standing'' there waiting for the time to pass. I think having 2 people gazing at the sky, maybe holding hands, or interacting in some way, would''ve helped you.', '2011-06-11 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441436, 956273, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness and texture in this image.</td>', 'I like the sharpness and texture in this image.', '2011-06-11 20:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441437, 955885, 58634, '<td valign="top">Overall, a good image. I feel like maybe the blueish tone in the sky could pop out a bit more with the help of some post processing. <br/>and this might sound weird, but this image makes me feel as if she has no arms? LOL</td>', 'Overall, a good image. I feel like maybe the blueish tone in the sky could pop out a bit more with the help of some post processing. and this might sound weird, but this image makes me feel as if she has no arms? LOL', '2011-06-11 20:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
