(6441503, 956318, 58634, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the colors in this image, but I''m having a hard time understanding the "why" of a person standing in that position except to create an interesting silhouette. Please don''t take that as an insult, I''m just curious. Still, I think it''s a well composed overall great image and gave you a 7.</td>', 'I enjoy the colors in this image, but I''m having a hard time understanding the "why" of a person standing in that position except to create an interesting silhouette. Please don''t take that as an insult, I''m just curious. Still, I think it''s a well composed overall great image and gave you a 7.', '2011-06-11 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
