(6441506, 956321, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the setup of this image and how well lit everything in the background is. I also like the fact that the girl is in an awkward or different position than expected.</td>', 'I like the setup of this image and how well lit everything in the background is. I also like the fact that the girl is in an awkward or different position than expected.', '2011-06-11 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441507, 956184, 58634, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup, IMO. I just wish we could see more of the interaction of the people (though still as a silhouette). Maybe a tighter crop would help?<br/>I think the textures throughout the image are gorgeous though!</td>', 'Excellent setup, IMO. I just wish we could see more of the interaction of the people (though still as a silhouette). Maybe a tighter crop would help?I think the textures throughout the image are gorgeous though!', '2011-06-11 20:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
