(6443447, 955293, 114285, '<td valign="top">So lovely. 9</td>', 'So lovely. 9', '2011-06-14 02:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443448, 955267, 114285, '<td valign="top">Now that''s special. 10 and probably a ribbon.</td>', 'Now that''s special. 10 and probably a ribbon.', '2011-06-14 02:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443449, 955954, 114285, '<td valign="top">Pristine. 9</td>', 'Pristine. 9', '2011-06-14 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443450, 956265, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, 9.</td>', 'Cool shot, 9.', '2011-06-14 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443554, 955267, 49109, '<td valign="top">I really can''t imagine this was real; if not - excellent work; if it''s real - you''re a lucky guy/gal. The blue is a bit oversaturated IMO.</td>', 'I really can''t imagine this was real; if not - excellent work; if it''s real - you''re a lucky guy/gal. The blue is a bit oversaturated IMO.', '2011-06-14 10:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443599, 956167, 77196, '<td valign="top">The bird is cool - not sure if that was planned or not, but still add a nice touch. I''m also kind-of wondering if snipers hand-hold very often, or if they''re more like low-light photographers, and use a tripod or other way to support the rifle. The shot has a bit of ghosting outline around the dark areas. Ont the plus side - great sky; the "barbed wire" behind the sniper, the bird, and the overall mood of the shot.</td>', 'The bird is cool - not sure if that was planned or not, but still add a nice touch. I''m also kind-of wondering if snipers hand-hold very often, or if they''re more like low-light photographers, and use a tripod or other way to support the rifle. The shot has a bit of ghosting outline around the dark areas. Ont the plus side - great sky; the "barbed wire" behind the sniper, the bird, and the overall mood of the shot.', '2011-06-14 12:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443600, 956184, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this. Nice setting that kind-of says, the actors may change, but love is timeless.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this. Nice setting that kind-of says, the actors may change, but love is timeless.', '2011-06-14 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443606, 956317, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow, but IMO the shot is conflicted. The main visual elements are the chain and the light to its right. For me, a tighter crop on the dancer would have clarified the focal point of the shot.</td>', 'Nice shadow, but IMO the shot is conflicted. The main visual elements are the chain and the light to its right. For me, a tighter crop on the dancer would have clarified the focal point of the shot.', '2011-06-14 12:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443609, 956135, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ooooh! Lightning. Bet a direct strike wouldn''t do your camera electronics any good... Shot looks a bit on the grainy side, but not distractingly so. Love the sky colors.</td>', 'Ooooh! Lightning. Bet a direct strike wouldn''t do your camera electronics any good... Shot looks a bit on the grainy side, but not distractingly so. Love the sky colors.', '2011-06-14 12:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443613, 955629, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost dream-like quality to this - tending more towards nightmare than pleasant dream, but not necessarily so. I like the use of the dark upper left corner (picture, mirror, you can''t really tell for sure). This will probably get slammed by the quick-draw voters, but I find it a nice solid entry with a great tie-in between "...at night" and dream / nightmare.</td>', 'Almost dream-like quality to this - tending more towards nightmare than pleasant dream, but not necessarily so. I like the use of the dark upper left corner (picture, mirror, you can''t really tell for sure). This will probably get slammed by the quick-draw voters, but I find it a nice solid entry with a great tie-in between "...at night" and dream / nightmare.', '2011-06-14 12:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443614, 955214, 77196, '<td valign="top">Decent night shot, but it doesn''t "pull me in" - for me, this shot makes it too easy for me to be just an observer.</td>', 'Decent night shot, but it doesn''t "pull me in" - for me, this shot makes it too easy for me to be just an observer.', '2011-06-14 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443632, 956268, 77196, '<td valign="top">What do I see? Look! Down the alley. A shadow creeps. Barely visible; Then a fleeting, sharp outline in a dim patch of light. Others sleep, or are unaware. But I stand at my window and stare. What is that? lurking there?</td>', 'What do I see? Look! Down the alley. A shadow creeps. Barely visible; Then a fleeting, sharp outline in a dim patch of light. Others sleep, or are unaware. But I stand at my window and stare. What is that? lurking there?', '2011-06-14 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443633, 956288, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blue / monochrome, and skeletons'' poses.</td>', 'Nice use of blue / monochrome, and skeletons'' poses.', '2011-06-14 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443637, 955293, 77196, '<td valign="top">The gate that leads to who knows where. A sunset, and ending perhaps, or just a delay - ''Til it rushes ''round to start a new day.</td>', 'The gate that leads to who knows where. A sunset, and ending perhaps, or just a delay - ''Til it rushes ''round to start a new day.', '2011-06-14 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443641, 956302, 77196, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just my monitor, but a bit too dark. At first glance, a cat. At closer inspection, not. The gleam from the eye, the hind foot claws illuminated. The lack of anything to give perspective as to the size of the creature. This has a sinister feel to it. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Perhaps just my monitor, but a bit too dark. At first glance, a cat. At closer inspection, not. The gleam from the eye, the hind foot claws illuminated. The lack of anything to give perspective as to the size of the creature. This has a sinister feel to it. Very nicely done.', '2011-06-14 12:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443647, 955992, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the shine off the tile and the distance portrayed. Huge eye draw to nothing, and then you follow the other path - to the right, and notice the open door, and the back of shoes. Definite feel of mystery and curiosity as to what is going on. Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the shine off the tile and the distance portrayed. Huge eye draw to nothing, and then you follow the other path - to the right, and notice the open door, and the back of shoes. Definite feel of mystery and curiosity as to what is going on. Nicely done.', '2011-06-14 12:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443651, 956323, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nope. Too dark and too light. The pose does not come across as threatening - the "assailant''s" right hand looks like it is in his pocked, and (maybe just my monitor), it is too dark to see anything threatening in his left hand. Also, the tilt of his head is more inquiring than threatening. <br/>The pattern in the floor, and texture of the bricks in the floor and the walls is very nice.</td>', 'Nope. Too dark and too light. The pose does not come across as threatening - the "assailant''s" right hand looks like it is in his pocked, and (maybe just my monitor), it is too dark to see anything threatening in his left hand. Also, the tilt of his head is more inquiring than threatening. The pattern in the floor, and texture of the bricks in the floor and the walls is very nice.', '2011-06-14 12:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443653, 956130, 77196, '<td valign="top">What? The attack feet from outer space? To me, that doesn''t look like a TV screen, but a textured floor of some kind (not carpet).</td>', 'What? The attack feet from outer space? To me, that doesn''t look like a TV screen, but a textured floor of some kind (not carpet).', '2011-06-14 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443654, 955396, 77196, '<td valign="top">The person adds a pensive feel to the shot - a bit of life in a restless universe.</td>', 'The person adds a pensive feel to the shot - a bit of life in a restless universe.', '2011-06-14 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443655, 956198, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the empty chairs to emphasize the feeling of "alone".</td>', 'Nice use of the empty chairs to emphasize the feeling of "alone".', '2011-06-14 12:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6443657, 956320, 77196, '<td valign="top">The white of the eye, and the tilt to the shot definitely makes this fit the title.</td>', 'The white of the eye, and the tilt to the shot definitely makes this fit the title.', '2011-06-14 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
