(6445864, 956049, 49716, '<td valign="top">I didn''t have a chance to vote on this challenge, but like the shot and the framing.  Noise reduction by Neat Image, or if you have it in Lightroom 3 (to name just two programmes) is really good and can remove colour and luminance noise very effectively.</td>', 'I didn''t have a chance to vote on this challenge, but like the shot and the framing.  Noise reduction by Neat Image, or if you have it in Lightroom 3 (to name just two programmes) is really good and can remove colour and luminance noise very effectively.', '2011-06-17 07:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
