(6445878, 956321, 129267, '<td valign="top">Coming back to this, I think I have to agree with OldBimmer, it''s not the scene that I found to be distracting, I kind of like the environment, it''s that the border is encroaching on the space, especially with how cropped the scene is already.  -- and I still like the pose, and the smidge of detail visible.</td>', 'Coming back to this, I think I have to agree with OldBimmer, it''s not the scene that I found to be distracting, I kind of like the environment, it''s that the border is encroaching on the space, especially with how cropped the scene is already.  -- and I still like the pose, and the smidge of detail visible.', '2011-06-17 08:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
