(6449269, 956195, 126418, '<td valign="top">Hey All,<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments. I agree with them all and have some things to work on that can improve the image further. Funnily after reviewing the other images this is the one I like the least because the speak runs through the clouds and leaves all that empty space above it. . I have another image where Olly is kicking and thrusting the spear, this his body filling the empty space on the left of the image but his leg and speak positioned in balance with the clouds and sun.<br/> <br/>But, all in all I am really chuffed to come 10th out of 54 with some great comments and suggestions for improvement. <br/> <br/>Thank you all for voting and commenting. <br/> <br/>Matt</td>', 'Hey All, Thanks for your comments. I agree with them all and have some things to work on that can improve the image further. Funnily after reviewing the other images this is the one I like the least because the speak runs through the clouds and leaves all that empty space above it. . I have another image where Olly is kicking and thrusting the spear, this his body filling the empty space on the left of the image but his leg and speak positioned in balance with the clouds and sun. But, all in all I am really chuffed to come 10th out of 54 with some great comments and suggestions for improvement.  Thank you all for voting and commenting.  Matt', '2011-06-21 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
