(6458266, 955267, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MargaretN:</b></div><hr/><i> Revisited this again - it looks like it was taken in daytime, am I right? PP turned it into the night? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was taken at 8:55 PM, well after sunset.  Not pitch black dark, no, but it was night time.</td>', 'Originally posted by MargaretN: Revisited this again - it looks like it was taken in daytime, am I right? PP turned it into the night?   It was taken at 8:55 PM, well after sunset.  Not pitch black dark, no, but it was night time.', '2011-07-01 20:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
